{
  "name": "Primal Knowledge",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain Proficiency in another skill of your choice from the skill list available to Barbarians at level 1.</p><p>In addition, while your Rage is active, you can channel primal power when you attempt certain tasks; whenever you make an Ability Check using one of the following skills, you can make it as a Strength check even if it normally uses a different ability: Acrobatics, Intimidation, Perception, Stealth, or Survival. When you use this ability, your Strength represents primal power coursing through you, honing your agility, bearing, and senses.</p>",
